\title{Post PhD (2024 - 2025)}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2025-09-03}

\p{
    Since my PhD has ended, I went through a process of unifying my various interests in people,
    proofs, smart contracts, digital money, and zero-knowledge proofs.
    I took a job with [Certora](dhsorens-001Z) straight out of my PhD, doing a mix of formally
    verifying smart contracts and project managmenet/business development/product development/client
    support.
    Ultimately, it became clear that [Certora](dhsorens-001Z) was not the place that I was going to
    do my best work, so early 2025 we parted ways.
}

\p{
    I then took some temporary contract work over the summer of 2025 building, designing, and
    verifying DeFi protocols (my specific area of expertise) while I looked for something that I can
    truly sink my teeth into and that would define the next period of my career.
}